 HISTORY                                                          3047 1451
 -------                                                          3047 1451
 The inelastic thermal scattering law data for HF was developed   3047 1451
 by the Low Energy Interaction Physics (LEIP) group at North      3047 1451
 Carolina State University (USA) using molecular dynamics         3047 1451
 methods [1,2]. This material is a liquid, such that the          3047 1451
 diffusive contribution is included. The FLASSH code was used     3047 1451
 with a Schofield diffusion model to produce File 7 for H in HF   3047 1451
 [3].                                                             3047 1451
